有。知识库文档正文的读写接口在 **文档/文件 > 文档** 分类下，与知识库管理接口分开组织：

**写入正文：**
- [插入内容](https://open.dingtalk.com/document/development/api-insertcontent) — 在文档指定位置插入 Markdown 内容
- [覆写文档（应用授权）](https://open.dingtalk.com/document/development/api-doc-updatecontent) — 以 Markdown 格式覆写整篇文档
- [覆写文档（个人授权）](https://open.dingtalk.com/document/development/api-docupdatecontent) — 同上，需用户授权
- [插入块元素](https://open.dingtalk.com/document/development/api-docinsertblocks) / [更新块元素](https://open.dingtalk.com/document/development/api-docblocksmodify) / [删除块元素](https://open.dingtalk.com/document/development/api-docdeleteblock.md)
- [在段落末尾追加文本](https://open.dingtalk.com/document/development/api-docappendtext)

**读取正文：**
- [查询块元素](https://open.dingtalk.com/document/development/api-docblocksquery) — 查询文档根节点下的一级块元素（段落、标题、表格等）

这些接口使用 `docKey`/`dentryUuid` 定位文档，文档描述中明确写的是"通过**创建知识库文档**接口创建文档后从返回值中获取 docKey"——说明它们是知识库文档的内容读写接口。

参考文档：
- [文档概述](https://open.dingtalk.com/document/development/dingtalk-document-overview)
- [知识库概述](https://open.dingtalk.com/document/development/knowledge-base-overview)
- [插入内容](https://open.dingtalk.com/document/development/api-insertcontent)
- [查询块元素](https://open.dingtalk.com/document/development/api-docblocksquery)
- [覆写文档（应用授权）](https://open.dingtalk.com/document/development/api-doc-updatecontent)
